From ce476531c9b47127cdba9992bffeb9d107730150 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dom Cobley <popcornmix@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 21 Dec 2025 16:37:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/11] DVDVideoCodecDRMPRIME: support software filters for
 deinterlace and conversion

Allow use of bwdif for deinterlace, copy for codecs that do not support custom allocators
(get_buffer2) like AV1, and scale for format conversion (e.g. 12-bit video).
---
 .../DVDCodecs/Video/DVDVideoCodecDRMPRIME.cpp | 161 +++++++++++++++---
 .../DVDCodecs/Video/DVDVideoCodecDRMPRIME.h   |   4 +
 2 files changed, 141 insertions(+), 24 deletions(-)

diff --git a/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDCodecs/Video/DVDVideoCodecDRMPRIME.cpp b/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDCodecs/Video/DVDVideoCodecDRMPRIME.cpp
